cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the pre-trained models, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "JTR-Marine: joint training across streamer geometries for missing-trace reconstruction"
abstract: >-
  Code and pre-trained models accompanying the paper "Joint training across
  streamer geometries for missing-trace reconstruction: A comparative
  evaluation on real marine data". A single compact U-Net conditioned on
  streamer length (FiLM) is trained jointly on six real marine lines with
  1500, 3000 and 4500 m streamers and compared with POCS, MSSA, the Chai
  et al. (2020) U-Net and other deep-learning variants on held-out lines and
  on Marmousi.
